\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page-wrap\">\n    <article class=\"page\">\n      <header class=\"header\">\n        <div>Knowledge area</div>\n        <div>Notes area</div>\n      </header>\n\n      <section class=\"notes\">\n        <div class=\"top-line blue\">\n          2, 开口方向：括号内取0（顶点式）；$a=-?$（一般式）\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"formula-row\">\n          <div class=\"formula\">\n            <span class=\"arrow\">↓</span>\n            <div class=\"purple\">$y=(x-[?])^2$</div>\n            <div class=\"parabola\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"formula down\">\n            <span class=\"arrow\">↓</span>\n            <div class=\"purple\">$y=-2x^2-3x+3$</div>\n            <div class=\"parabola\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">\n          <span class=\"red\">例题</span> <span class=\"green\">精讲</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"entry blue\">[例1(1)] [illegible] 福安庭园门拱高</p>\n        <p class=\"entry blue\">用二次函数 $y=2(x-3)^2+1$，问知（<span class=\"red\">B</span>）</p>\n\n        <p class=\"entry blue\">\n          A，其图象的开口向下\n          <span class=\"mark\">× $a&gt;0$ 向上</span>\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"entry blue\">\n          B，其图象的顶点坐标为（1，1）\n          <span class=\"mark\">√ 对应为（3,1）</span>\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"entry blue\">\n          C，其图象的对称轴为直线 $x=2$\n          <span class=\"mark\">×</span>\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"entry blue\">\n          D，当 $x=3$ 时，$y$ 随着 $x$ 的增大而增大\n          <span class=\"mark\">×</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"small-note\">再小</div>\n\n        <div class=\"example-two\">\n          <p class=\"entry blue\">例1(2)</p>\n          <p class=\"entry blue\">\n            对于二次函数 $y=x^2-2x+1$，下列说法中正确的是（<span class=\"red\">D</span>）\n          </p>\n          <p class=\"entry blue\">\n            A，函数图象关于对称轴有交点 $x=1$\n            <span class=\"mark\">对称轴：$\\frac{-b}{2a}=1$</span>\n          </p>\n          <p class=\"entry blue\">\n            B，函数图象的顶点坐标为（1，-2）\n            <span class=\"mark\">（1，?）</span>\n          </p>\n          <p class=\"entry blue\">\n            <span class=\"red\">当 $x=1$ 时，$y=1-2+1=0$</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder signature-placeholder\" aria-label=\"Notebook handwriting mark\"></div>\n    </article>\n\n    <aside class=\"edge\" aria-label=\"Notebook edge tabs\">\n      <div class=\"tab\">1</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">2</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">3</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">4</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">5</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">6</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">7</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">8</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">9</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">10</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">11</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">12</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">13</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">14</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">15</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">16</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">17</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">18</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">19</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">20</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">21</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">22</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">23</div>\n      <div class=\"tab\">24</div>\n    </aside>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
